ERPLAB averaged ERP derivatives
================================

This folder contains de-identified ERPLAB averaged ERP files for 27 participants.

These files are derivatives, not raw EEG data.

Original ERPLAB .erp files were anonymized before public sharing. Potentially identifying fields such as ERP.history, original ERP.filepath, original ERP.filename, and original ERP.erpname were removed or replaced.

Naming convention:

  sub-XX/eeg/sub-XX_task-symbolic_desc-averagedERP_erp.erp
  sub-XX/eeg/sub-XX_task-symbolic_desc-averagedERP_erp.json

Participant identifiers are sequential and anonymized. Original excluded IDs are not preserved in the public filenames.

The private original-to-anonymized mapping file is created only for local record keeping and must not be uploaded to a public repository.

The .erp format is preserved to allow reuse in ERPLAB.
